              {
                "text": "Rely on a one-time filter and skip later monitoring.",
                "is_correct": false,
                "error_type": "Lifecycle-gap misconception",
                "rationale": "A one-time filter does not satisfy lifecycle-wide responsibility. Risks and system behavior must also be addressed during operation.",
                "better_fit": "A filter may be one component within an ongoing guardrail program.",
                "feedback": {
